  "ingredients": [
    "3 pounds red potatoes, peeled and sliced",
    "6 ounces Gouda cheese, shredded, divided",
    "3 tablespoons butter",
    "5 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1.5 cups heavy cream",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 teaspoon black pepper"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Lightly grease a 9x13 inch baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/z71VXk3lE9UlmIHpSWxJ5RjuN6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25891-garlic-potatoes-gratin-VAT-step-01-d790c1ce6db8403ebc39eabed0471225.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25891/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the prepared dish layer 1/2 of the potatoes, 1/2 of the cheese, then the remaining potatoes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mER_zv0yAdqqmSYd4HIz_8bH6hM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25891-garlic-potatoes-gratin-VAT-step-02-8df04167b3f845608cd8f7919a673ce6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25891/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt the butter in a small skillet over medium heat. Saute garlic until fragrant and golden brown; pour over potatoes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/VQqqsbB_4DoDD8p02cSf0U5-a90=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25891-garlic-potatoes-gratin-VAT-step-03-986df36558134dbe8e5765533ba33d27.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25891/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine cream, salt and pepper; pour evenly over potatoes and sprinkle with remaining cheese.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EM4uM2mcWhrg9Jn_g63b2433_N0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/25891-garlic-potatoes-gratin-VAT-step-04-966f3d42622540b08861163d7b12caab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/25891/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in preheated oven for 75 minutes. Serve immediately.",
